.Sh STANDARDS
Symbol binding, type, and visibility values follow the ELF specification.
See
.Xr elfobj 3
for references.
.Sh HISTORY
Symbol handling has been a core feature of
.Nm libelfobj
since its initial implementation.
.Sh BUGS
.Bl -bullet
.It
There is no API to iterate symbols by index directly.
Applications must either store symbol handles during creation
or use
.Fn elf_find_symbol
with known names.
.It
Symbol versioning support is incomplete.
.It
Visibility attributes cannot be set through the public API.
.El
